WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.738
Forty-six currently sitting Members of Parliament signed both Bill C-14 and Bill C-7.

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:09.943
Seventy-six thousand seven hundred and seven cumulative MAID deaths.

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:15.875
Five point one percent of all Canadian deaths in 2024 attributed to medical assistance in dying.

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.829
The United Nations Committee on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities called for Track 2 repeal.

00:00:20.829 --> 00:00:23.943
Ten provinces oppose mental illness expansion.

00:00:23.943 --> 00:00:30.238
Zero Members of Parliament have been held accountable — despite unanimous opposition from medical officers and provinces.

00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:37.193
A lobbying nexus has been detected among MPs appearing on the Top 50 Most Lobbied Officials list in health and policy vectors.

00:00:37.193 --> 00:00:39.147
The people who voted for this are named.

00:00:39.147 --> 00:00:41.659
The people who died because of it are numbered.
